        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>This playbook provides a basic response to phishing incidents, including: - Calculating reputation for all indicators - Extracting indicators from email attachments - Calculating severity for the incident based on indicator reputation - Updating the reporting user about investigation status - Enabling manual incident remediation   This updated playbook uses:   1) Incident fields instead of labels   2) The &quot;Process Email - Core v2&quot; playbook</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>p1089</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>Phishing - Core v2</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


