        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>This playbook enables threat hunting for IOCs in your enterprise. It currently supports the following integrations: - Splunk - Qradar - Pan-os  - Cortex data lake  - Autofocus - Microsoft 365 Defender</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
