        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:providedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2025/1/IncidentResponseSecurityOntology#Vendor_XSOAR"/>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>This playbook tags indicators ingested from high reliability feeds. The playbook is triggered due to a Cortex XSOAR job. The indicators are tagged as approved_white, approved_black, approved_watchlist. The tagged indicators will be ready for consumption for 3rd party systems such as SIEM, EDR etc.</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
