        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>Don’t let your users fall for the same phish twice. This workflow uses a Slack command to find all emails in the target user&apos;s Office 365 inbox that match the provided search criteria. It will look for any emails that match the &apos;body&apos;, &apos;subject&apos;, and &apos;from&apos;. It will automatically delete these emails by using the `delete` flag.</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>p536</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>Find and Delete Emails in Office 365 from Slack</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


