        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>This workflow responds to any user event from InsightIDR and determines if the event occurred during or after office hours. Depending on the alert timestamp, the workflow will either automatically disable the user or post a human decision in Slack. Throughout the whole workflow, InsightConnect is creating and tracking the life cycle of the incident through Jira. </IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
