        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:providedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/user/ontologies/2025/1/IncidentResponseSecurityOntology#Vendor_Rapid7"/>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>Quarantining a compromised asset can limit the scope of an attack and buy valuable time to investigate and contain the threat. This workflow triggers on an InsightIDR UBA alert to quarantine an asset with the Insight Agent.</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>p594</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>Quarantine asset with Insight Agent from InsightIDR UBA Alert</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>
