        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>IDR provides built-in machine learning based detections of spearphishing attempts through DNS queries to spoofed domains. On alert generation, this workflow automatically deletes true positive phishing emails across all user inboxes, and also immediately adds a domain to a block transport rule in Office365 Security &amp; Compliance Center.</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookDescription>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>p625</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookID>
        <IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>Spearphishing Remediation with Office365</IncidentResponseSecurityOntology:hasPlaybookName>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


